{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42305","headline":"送高舍人使岭南 · 徐铉","name":"送高舍人使岭南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西掖官曹近，南溟道路遥。\n使星将渡汉，仙櫂乍乘潮。\n柳映灵和折，梅依大庾飘。\n江帆风淅淅，山馆雨萧萧。\n陆贾真迂阔，终童久寂寥。\n送君何限意，把酒一长谣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}